<title>UK: Japanese stocks in London trade quietly higher.</title>
<headline>Japanese stocks in London trade quietly higher.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in Japanese stocks in London was light on Tuesday following a further fall in the Nikkei Dow, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;It's been very quiet although some blue-chip companies managed to finish a little higher,&quot; said one dealer.</p>
<p>By 1540 GMT, the Nikkei 50 index was up 0.77 to 1,654.57 despite the Nikkei Dow losing 153.62 points to 19,514.45 in Tokyo.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7954</p>
